Z||000001||The Fieromaster||07-10-2001||12:35 AM||||Say bye bye clear coat...  When mine started that crap i sanded em down and painted them... It wont hurt your wheels at all... Unlike rust on metal, aluminum oxidation wont kill the metal and eat it alive... it just makes it look like $hit!<P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That Wrecked Better"<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">     <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>AIM: Fieromaster<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
