Z||000011||Leadfoot||07-11-2001||05:26 PM||||One more important thing...use mothers aluminum polish for the final step.  It will give a more brillant shine and protect the aluminum.  <P>**WARNING: do not stare directly at the wheels on a sunny day!**  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">||||reg||1
